<%--
People_List - a calm vertical list of people (avatar + name), never a pill cloud

$people (array)      - [{name, avatar_url?, initials?, subtitle?}] rows to render [required]
$clickable (bool)    - rows react to the pointer; a click fires `person_click` [optional]
$removable (bool)    - each row shows a remove button; a click fires `person_remove` [optional]
$size ("sm"|"md")    - avatar disc size (default "sm") [optional]
$empty_text (string) - muted line rendered when $people is empty; omitted -> nothing [optional]

Fires: person_click(component, {person, index}), person_remove(component, {person, index}).

The shared people-list display PRIMITIVE (guide 6.5: converge the SHAPE, keep the
domain wrappers). Each row is a Person_Avatar + name (+ optional subtitle). A scannable
stacked list - NEVER a wrapping pill cloud. Consumed by the request-thread participant
groups (staff + portal side); $removable is the opt-in write affordance for a future
membership editor. The list stays domain-free: it hands the exact person object back on
click, so the owning action never re-derives which row was hit.

Usage:
    <People_List $sid="members" $people=_members $clickable=true />
    this.sid('members').on('person_click', (c, d) => Modal.show(d.person));
--%>
<Define:People_List tag="div">
    <% const _people = this.args.people || [];
       const _size = this.args.size === 'md' ? 'md' : 'sm';
       const _clickable = !!this.args.clickable;
       const _removable = !!this.args.removable; %>
    <% if (_people.length === 0) { %>
        <% if (this.args.empty_text) { %>
            <span class="People_List__empty"><%= this.args.empty_text %></span>
        <% } %>
    <% } else { %>
        <% for (let _i = 0; _i < _people.length; _i++) { %>
            <% const _p = _people[_i];
               const _row_class = 'People_List__row' + (_clickable ? ' People_List__row--clickable' : ''); %>
            <div class="<%= _row_class %>" data-person-index="<%= _i %>" title="<%= str(_p.name) %>">
                <Person_Avatar $name="<%= str(_p.name) %>" $avatar_url="<%= str(_p.avatar_url) %>" $initials="<%= str(_p.initials) %>" $size="<%= _size %>" />
                <div class="People_List__body">
                    <span class="People_List__name"><%= str(_p.name) %></span>
                    <% if (_p.subtitle) { %>
                        <span class="People_List__subtitle"><%= _p.subtitle %></span>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
                <% if (_removable) { %>
                    <button type="button" class="People_List__remove" data-person-remove="<%= _i %>" title="Remove">
                        <i class="bi bi-x"></i>
                    </button>
                <% } %>
            </div>
        <% } %>
    <% } %>
</Define:People_List>
